# Compiled binaries. Both paths are spelled out DELIBERATELY: an unanchored
# `realm-id` also matches the DIRECTORY cmd/realm-id/, which silently ignores
# every NEW file added under it (verified: an untracked cmd/realm-id/x.go is
# reported ignored by that pattern; already-tracked files are unaffected, so
# the breakage would show up only on the next file someone adds).
/realm-id
/cmd/realm-id/realm-id
/dist/
*.out
